#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:2 c5c65a16c96a4d199f3dc92b10458b99
msgid "_`Metadata Configuration`"
msgstr "元数据配置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:5 b18c78e209bb4f30a580244209b77200
msgid "_`Project-level Settings`"
msgstr "项目级设置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:7 f761ecae533d4462927d9902ed3d00ab
msgid "The metadata.json file contains the metadata configuration for this project, including basic project information, build configuration, and dependency definitions."
msgstr "metadata.json 是本项目的元数据配置，包含基本信息、构建配置与依赖定义。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:11 d1fc13bd30934c17993160d517cfd011
msgid "_`File Structure`"
msgstr "文件结构"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:13 f46bf44249c94e26a6b702c49bbc83b4
msgid ""
"The JSON file includes sections for basic project information (name, "
"version, license, description), authors and maintainers, build "
"configuration (CMake version, C/C++ standards), module settings, "
"dependency definitions, and documentation configuration."
msgstr ""
"该 JSON 文件包含基本项目信息（名称、版本、许可证、描述）、作者和维护者、构建配置（CMake 版本、C/C++ "
"标准）、模块设置、依赖定义以及文档配置等部分。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:18 9d4ae0dd8801449aa98999298294498a
msgid "_`Key Settings`"
msgstr "关键设置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:20 30d149d2302a43df8b0b718fe6ae0bb3
msgid ""
"Basic project information defines the package identity. Build "
"configuration specifies tool versions and language standards. Module "
"settings control standard and user module usage. Dependencies are "
"categorized into common, C-specific, and C++-specific requirements. "
"Documentation settings configure Doxygen generation."
msgstr ""
"基本项目信息定义了包的身份标识。构建配置指定了工具版本和语言标准。模块设置控制标准和用户模块的使用。依赖项被归类为通用、C 专用和 C++ "
"专用需求。文档设置用于配置 Doxygen 生成。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:24 2b3c3366e3654d74944be95f225d2048
msgid ""
"Example configuration demonstrates how to set up a project with C++20 "
"support, module generation, and common dependencies like Boost and "
"OpenCV."
msgstr "示例配置展示了如何设置一个支持 C++20、模块生成以及包含 Boost 和 OpenCV 等通用依赖的项目。"
